@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Registro de usuario -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Xavier Bazan",
  "email": "xavier@example.com",
  "password": "Secreta123"
}

### Registro con datos inválidos -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "",
  "email": "no-es-un-email",
  "password": "123"
}

### Registro con email repetido -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Otro Usuario",
  "email": "xavier@example.com",
  "password": "Secreta123"
}

### Login correcto -> 200 con token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "xavier@example.com",
  "password": "Secreta123"
}

### Login con contraseña incorrecta -> 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "xavier@example.com",
  "password": "Incorrecta1"
}

### Perfil del usuario autenticado -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/perfil
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Perfil sin token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/perfil

### Perfil con token inválido -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/perfil
Authorization: Bearer token.invalido.123
